}
```
skipTip shows while creator? Creator confirm → runMatch shows skipTip — fine (match running).

But also title screen hide — creator.open already hides title. ok.

Also newGame() makeContestant(true, PLAYER_NAMES random): uses config now, name passed overrides. But name used is passed param (PLAYER_NAMES random) not config name! In newGame: `const player = makeContestant(true, RC.PLAYER_NAMES[RC.ri(0,...)])`. Should use RC.PLAYER_CONFIG.name if set. Same newGameKeepPlayer uses pName from old player (which was named via startFromCreator? player.name was set at makeContestant with passed name). preTitleRat passes config name or random. startFromCreator does not rename player — player.name stays from preTitleRat (random). Fix: makeContestant default name param: if isPlayer && RC.PLAYER_CONFIG and !name → use config name. Simplest: in newGame, name: `(RC.PLAYER_CONFIG && RC.PLAYER_CONFIG.name) || pick(PLAYER_NAMES)`. And startFromCreator set player.name = config.name too.

